    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through a labyrinth of stone and steel, where a lone sci-fi soldier faces an army of invading robots. Hunt for weapons, scavenge vital pickups, and clear each gate-locked arena in a relentless fight for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A devastating arsenal of sci-fi weapons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast movement, tight strafing, no aim-down-sights or reloads </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted non-linear levels with pickups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Short, self-contained campaign with replayable combat arenas </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized low-poly retro-fantasy setting</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Only the beginning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first episode, a short, focused release made by a solo developer. Designed for classic boomer shooter fans, it delivers tight combat, responsive movement, and polished action.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through a labyrinth of stone and steel, where a lone sci-fi soldier faces an army of invading robots. Hunt for weapons, scavenge vital pickups, and clear each gate-locked arena in a relentless fight for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A devastating arsenal of sci-fi weapons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast movement, tight strafing, no aim-down-sights or reloads </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted non-linear levels with pickups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Short, self-contained campaign with replayable combat arenas </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized low-poly retro-fantasy setting</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Only the beginning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first episode, a short, focused release made by a solo developer. Designed for classic boomer shooter fans, it delivers tight combat, responsive movement, and polished action.</p>",
    "short_description": "Blast through a dungeon overrun by robots. Scavenging health and ammo pickups, unlock gates, and turn every last invader into scrap using your powerful arsenal.",
